      "lat": 83.92143,
      "lng": -168.06018,
      "wikiPage": "Imperial_Audience",
      "checklistTaskId": 65193903,
      "mapgenieId": 555352,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 2 _Geralt had spent years looking for Yennefer, only to have her find him. She had appeared outside the tavern in White Orchard, escorted by Nilfgaardian soldiers. The one-time lovers could not enjoy their reunion, for the sorceress had insisted they make haste._ Rewards: - None",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:vizima-palace:555353:632",
      "name": "The Nilfgaardian Connection",
      "slug": "555353",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.89683,
      "lng": -168.1586,
      "wikiPage": "The_Nilfgaard_Connection",
      "checklistTaskId": 65193904,
      "mapgenieId": 555353,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 5 _Geralt traveled to Velen in search of Ciri, an act that attested to the depth of his devotion. Only a man who has been to this land can know just how vile it is. At this time it was commonly known as No Man's Land. Why? Well, the emperor of Nilfgaard had not yet claimed it, Temeria was in disarray, and the Redanians had already retreated north. No Man had been left in charge, and he had proved a terrible ruler._ Rewards: - 100 XP",
      "link": null
    },
